<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-046" chapter-id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context" source-id="s-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context-ws2197034">
  <p id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p001:m0000" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_AA">杜崱</persName>，京兆杜陵人也。其先自北歸南，居於雍州之襄陽，子孫因家焉。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p001:m0032" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu">靈啓</persName>，齊給事中。父<persName id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p001:m0041" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_A">懷寶</persName>，</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p002:m0000" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p002:m0002" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_AA">崱</persName>第二兄<persName id="c-liangshu-046-dukans-family-context:p002:m0006" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_AB">岑</persName>之子。</p>
</text>
